%
( FREZE - "CNC" YAZISI + CERCEVE )
( Makine: Mill / BenchMill. Kutuk: 120 x 80 x 30 mm, X/Y sifiri ortada, Z0 ust yuzey )
( T2 = 6mm parmak freze. Harfler 1.5mm, cerceve 1mm derinlikte )
( Alt program ornegi: C harfi bir kez tanimlanir, iki kez cagrilir )

( C harfi. #1 = harfin merkez X'i )
o100 sub
  G0 X[#1 + 11.276] Y10.104
  G1 Z-1.5 F120
  G3 X[#1 - 12.0] Y6.0 I-11.276 J-4.104 F300
  G1 Y-6.0
  G3 X[#1 + 11.276] Y-10.104 I12.0 J0.0
  G0 Z5.0
o100 endsub

G21 G17 G90 G54

T2 M6
G43
S3200 M3
G0 Z10.0

o100 call [-36.0]

( N harfi )
G0 X-10.0 Y-16.0
G1 Z-1.5 F120
G1 Y16.0 F300
G1 X10.0 Y-16.0
G1 Y16.0
G0 Z5.0

o100 call [36.0]

( --- koseleri yuvarlak cerceve --- )
G0 X-50.0 Y-36.0
G1 Z-1.0 F120
G1 X50.0 F350
G3 X56.0 Y-30.0 I0.0 J6.0
G1 Y30.0
G3 X50.0 Y36.0 I-6.0 J0.0
G1 X-50.0
G3 X-56.0 Y30.0 I0.0 J-6.0
G1 Y-30.0
G3 X-50.0 Y-36.0 I6.0 J0.0
G0 Z50.0

M5
G0 X0.0 Y0.0
M2
%
